# <type>(<scope>)!: <summary>   (≤72 chars, imperative, no period)
#
# Types: feat fix docs style refactor perf test build ci chore revert
# Scope (optional): cli, config, input, matcher, planner, runner, libby, thunder, deps
# "!" after type/scope = breaking change; also add a BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
#
# Body: what and why, not how. Wrap at 100.
#
# Footers:
#   Closes #123
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#   Co-authored-by: Name <email>
#
# Enable: git config commit.template .gitmessage
